  "img": "icons/skills/trades/academics-astronomy-navigation-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can consult your Star Map for omens and roll a die. Until you finish your next Long Rest, you gain access to a special Reaction based on whether you rolled an even or an odd number on the die:</p><p><strong>Weal (Even).</strong> Whenever a creature you can see within 30 feet of you is about to make a D20 Test, you can take a Reaction to roll 1d6 and add the number rolled to the total.</p><p><strong>Woe (Odd). </strong>Whenever a creature you can see within 30 feet of you is about to make a D20 Test, you can take a Reaction to roll 1d6 and subtract the number rolled from the total.</p><p>You can use this Reaction a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-4KkQJd5AOz4q4G76\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Weal</strong> and <strong>Woe</strong> activities will consume a use of this feature and provide an Add or Subtract roll.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
